            "review_title": "Review at Bamboo Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Thea Ho\n1 contribution\n0\nDelicious Dumplings at Bamboo Restaurant\nDec 2022 • Family\nWe had all you can eat yum cha at the restaurant. We left with a full belly of delicious food. The service was also delightful. My partner has a tree nut allergy and staff was super thoughtful and thorough. Thank you for having us and highly recommend!\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 30, 2022\nLoan N\nDear Valued Guest,\n\nWe appreciate you taking the time to share your recent experience with us at Bamboo restaurant, where it was our pleasure to serve you.We highly appreciate that you found our overall products and services to your satisfaction.We hope to see you again soon\n\nRegards,\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
